  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Insights and Evidence 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Insights and Evidence 2024-27 Activity will deliver an increased number of insights and evidence products about NZ&apos;s&#xa0;International Development Cooperation (IDC) Programme delivery performance and the strategic contexts in which&#xa0;Pacific and Development Group (PDG) operates.&#xa0;This Activity will include providing a wider and deeper understanding of learnings, issues, challenges and successes by producing syntheses across evaluations and research reports as well as producing annual projects.</narrative>
  </description>
